					<dc:identifier>http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2003/2426/regulation/6</dc:identifier><dc:title>The Privacy and Electronic Communications (EC Directive) Regulations 2003</dc:title><dc:type>text</dc:type><dc:format>text/xml</dc:format><dc:language>en</dc:language><dc:publisher>Statute Law Database</dc:publisher><dc:subject scheme="SIheading">ELECTRONIC COMMUNICATIONS</dc:subject><dc:modified>2026-10-01</dc:modified><dc:contributor>Expert Participation</dc:contributor><dct:valid>2026-09-30</dct:valid>
					<dc:description>These Regulations implement Articles 2, 4, 5(3), 6 to 13, 15 and 16 of Directive 2002/58/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 12 July 2002 concerning the processing of personal data and the protection of privacy in the electronic communications sector (Directive on privacy and electronic communications) (“the Directive”).</dc:description>
